          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Pursuant to the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission's Order Denying Petition and Granting Remedies issued November 20, 2025, we have included in Page 300, in revenue </xhtml:span>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">account 210, the amount of $2,900,204 related to correcting invoices from March 1, 2022 to September 17, 2024.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
